  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"And now you will be a great man in the town and I, too, will be a great man in the town and I will be a great man and I will go in and out as I like and I will be rich and will be honored and will be proud and I will be honored and will be proud.\"",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) The brothers shout at each other.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and am I not your father, and will you talk thus to your brother?\"",
